<style>
    body {
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
    }
</style>

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-md-8 bg-light p-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm">
            <h4 class="text-center fw-bold mb-4">Disclaimer</h4>

            <h6 class="fw-bold">Research Use</h6>
            <p>
                phyloDIVaS is an academic research platform intended for educational and research use. Results should not be treated as clinical or diagnostic guidance.
            </p>

            <h6 class="fw-bold">Data Accuracy</h6>
            <p>
                Data and results depend on public databases, third-party services, selected parameters, and the availability of external resources.
                Verify important findings against primary sources before publication or further analysis.
            </p>

            <h6 class="fw-bold">User Responsibilities</h6>
            <ul>
                <li>Review species, assemblies, and analysis parameters before starting a run.</li>
                <li>Validate generated results before relying on them.</li>
                <li>Follow the terms and citation requirements of external data providers.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
